poh@sei.cmu.edu (Peter Hill) writes:


>Help!
>I'm in Hell, I've just gotten The Amulet and I have somehow managed to acquire
>the intrinsic 'Aggravate monsters'  How do I get rid of it.  I'm getting my
>butt kicked bad.  Anyone got any sure fire remedies?

>Thanks, 
>Peter

Stealth.  Either a ring, or elven clothes (boots or cloak, perhaps the hat?
I'm not sure on that one.)

Spoiler about sneaking:

My favorite way to play the game is to be (A) invisible, (B) stealthy, (C)
displaced.  You can walk around virtually unnoticed.  Add a ring of conflict
and you're set.

BTW, invisibility gets you the same effect as displacement, but some monsters
have "see invisible" intrinsic too.

But stealth will negate agg. monster, which is an easy intrinsic to gain.
Be sure to never eat a dog or cat corpse, even if they are not your pet..
